00:23:54.166 --> 00:23:56.768 line:0%
Chevy Bolt EV owners, listen up.

00:23:56.768 --> 00:24:00.838 line:0%
Officials say some of your cars
could spontaneously catch fire.

00:24:00.838 --> 00:24:02.640 line:0%
-Oh, come -- come on!
-I'm sorry.

00:24:02.640 --> 00:24:04.709
Look, Tariq, I'm sure
you'll find something fun

00:24:04.709 --> 00:24:06.477
to do this summer.
-Yeah.

00:24:06.477 --> 00:24:08.712
Yeah, I'll be fine --
